**Requirement (Parameterized tile authority graph)** · `req:nrz:lc-grid-tile-authority`

Required capability, owned by CAS for mathematical authority and bindings for LC correspondence: establish scoped domain, relation, complete-cover, cycle-domain, boundary and physical-premise evidence at decision barriers over arrived values. Cache reusable exact strata ahead of time or after a miss, with content-keyed cuts and lemmas under (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-decision-cache`). Share original relation, pi, bracket and valid ancestor authority, adding only missing proofs. A point proof or schema hit cannot supply a whole-family theorem. Every projection direction needs scoped feasibility or unresolved-domain evidence. This realizes (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-tile-certificate`), (`rule:nrz:lc-grid-shared-nodes`) without reinstating a declared sensor support or pre-arrival admission gate.

**Requirement (Indexed input and output bindings)** · `req:nrz:lc-grid-indexed-binding`

